---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Learn about Hello by Hand — who we are, why we started, and how a simple handwritten card can change someone's day.">

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="max-w-2xl">
                <h1 class="font-display text-ink mb-4">About Hello by Hand</h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                    We started with a simple belief: that a handwritten note can change someone's entire day.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-cream-dark py-14 sm:py-20">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-ink mb-5">Our Story</h2>
                    <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Hello by Hand grew from a simple idea: seniors in care homes and retirement communities often go days, sometimes weeks, without receiving any personal correspondence. In an age of instant messaging, a handwritten card has become something rare and truly special.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        We believe making and sending a card shouldn't be complicated. Anyone can pick up a pen &mdash; a child, a grandparent, a whole classroom. And on the other end, someone's day is made a little brighter.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                        That's Hello by Hand. Cards made by people who care, delivered to people who deserve to know someone is thinking of them.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="aspect-square bg-parchment rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-6xl shadow-sm">
                    💌
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="font-display text-ink text-center mb-12">Why It Matters</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-parchment shadow-sm">
                    <div class="font-display text-5xl text-brand-pink font-bold mb-2">500+</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Cards Delivered</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-parchment shadow-sm">
                    <div class="font-display text-5xl text-brand-blue font-bold mb-2">120+</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Seniors Reached</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-parchment shadow-sm">
                    <div class="font-display text-5xl text-brand-pink font-bold mb-2">18</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Events Held</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-brand-blue text-white py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
                <h2 class="font-display text-white mb-5">What makes a good card?</h2>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    Just your words. It doesn't need to be long, fancy, or perfectly written. A simple &ldquo;Hello, thinking of you&rdquo; from a stranger can mean the world to someone who hasn't received a personal note in months.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h2 class="font-display text-ink mb-3">Ready to make someone's day?</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg mb-8 max-w-sm mx-auto">It only takes a few minutes and a little heart.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
                <a href="/get-involved" class="btn btn-lg">Get Involved</a>
                <a href="/book" class="btn btn-lg btn-outline">Host a Meetup</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>
